C10_DSDB       lhs=+0.000000000000e+00  rhs=+0.000000000000e+00  rel.res=+0.000e+00  tol=1e-15  PASS   static action has identically zero beta-derivative

[P2] the law from the first integral g_N = g - xi u,  xi g = K W'(u)
     g_N(g) = -g*(a0*xi**2 - a0 - g*xi)/(a0 + g*xi)
     xi=1:  g_N = g**2/(a0 + g)
